Inputs:
- instanceId: {{ instanceId }}
- nodeId: {{ nodeId }}
- nodeBundle: {{ nodeBundle }}
- nodeStatus: {{ nodeStatus }}
- instructions: {{ instructions }}

Follow the steps in the system instructions. First call drupal_node_get to read current content. If nodeStatus is 'published', call drupal_node_create_draft_revision BEFORE drupal_node_update — but only when a field actually needs to change. Return JSON exactly as Step 4 specifies — for a successful edit: {"nodeId":"...","changes":[{"field":"...","before":"...","after":"..."}]} (if no field actually needs to change, make no Drupal content write at all and return the NO-CHANGE RESULT shape instead)
